  m_Name: Midwinter Bonfire
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: SafeHaven::FestivalDefinition
  displayName: Midwinter Bonfire
  dayOfYear: 23
  hours: {x: 16.5, y: 24}
  announcement: It's Midwinter. Tonight the Haven keeps the bonfire burning against the long dark.
  lines:
  - The longest night. From tomorrow the light comes back, a little at a time.
  - Stand close to the fire. The cold can't have us tonight.
  - My grandmother said the dead come to warm themselves at Midwinter. Leave them room.
  - Burn a sprig of juniper for luck. Go on.
  - Listen. Even the woods are quiet tonight.
  music: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 7e12f4dd9fe56894bbc75084cfe02f39, type: 2}
